{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/5AuK01I9ayqaUAcjDMgAaw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:24.620105+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/5AuK01I9ayqaUAcjDMgAaw","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/kFX4Y5e2XrQAjXwX1ZibPHeoFnp7WgyHZApLCslia2iceBTHB7VheUlmDAIzibU4ELAvp6ucgISw82jvyck5gzd3rQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>上海理工大学管理学院专业学位教育中心拟于</span><span><strong><span><span>2025年7月5日至6日</span></span></strong></span><span>举办</span><span><strong><span><span>“2025年全国优秀大学生夏令营”</span></span></strong></span><span>，旨在促进全国优秀大学生之间的交流，增进学生对我校相关专业的全面了解，吸引基础扎实、热爱科研、德才兼备的优秀学生继续深造。活动期间将评选<span>“优秀夏令营营员”</span>若干名。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><span>获得“优秀夏令营营员”称号的同学，若获得推免资格且在推免系统开放期间填报我校对应专业，或2026年研究生招生统考报名期间第一志愿报考我校对应专业且初试成绩达到复试线，经复试选拔后，可获得同等条件下优先录取和评定奖学金的资格。</span></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><span><span>欢迎全国各大高校相关专业品学兼优的学子积极报名参加！</span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>一</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>夏令营专业</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>会计（MPAcc）</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>上海理工大学MPAcc项目致力于培养学生系统掌握现代会计、审计、财务管理及其相关领域知识技能，助力其在管理会计与会计智能化、先进制造业投融资、财务与会计、内部控制与审计等前沿领域构建系统知识体系，成长为高层次、应用型、国际化的会计专业人才。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>项目特色显著：融合会计理论与大数据审计、区块链等理工科优势；将会计理论与资本市场实务紧密结合；通过校外实践基地推动产学研协同；对接上海国际经济、金融、贸易、航运和科技创新“五个中心”建设，服务区域及全国财务需求。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>毕业生就业表现优异，2023届就业率达100％，就业领域广泛，部分学生读博深造；2024届超200人的毕业生规模，就业率高达96%，就业竞争力强劲。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>金融（MF）</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>上海理工大学管理学院金融硕士（沪江MF），旨在培养熟练掌握金融学原理、具备商业银行与投资银行运作、金融工程与金融科技及风险管理等技能，有效把握宏观经济和金融领域的运行状况，具有较强的分析与解决问题能力，适合在金融机构、政府部门和企事业单位，为长江经济带绿色创新高质量发展提供优质高效金融服务的应用型金融人才。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>国际商务（MIB）</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>上海理工大学国际商务硕士（MIB）专业对标AACSB国际知名商学院，教学和科研围绕为“中国走进和融入全球经济”服务这一大主题，立足于上海国际经济、金融、贸易、航运和科创“五个中心”建设的区域定位，致力于培养具有开放意识和国际视野，既严谨求实又具备创新能力，人格健全、勇于担当，德智体美全面发展，能够适应经济全球化和信息化时代发展并具有创新能力的高层次国际商务专门人才。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>税务（MT）</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>上海理工大学税务硕士（MT）学位点的发展根植于上海理工大学应用经济学和财政学20多年的研究生培养经验，具有良好的税务人才培养和国际化办学基础。本专业重点面向先进制造业、现代服务业、财税管理部门等，培养既系统掌握税收理论与政策相关专业知识、充分了解税务稽查、税务筹划以及税务代理等高级税收实务，又熟悉先进制造行业、高收入群体及数字经济动态，基础扎实、视野宽广，具备良好职业素养、社会责任感、善于沟通，能够解决税务实践问题的“创新型、技术型、应用型”高级税务专业人才。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>二</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>活动安排</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><strong><span>（一）活动方式</span></strong></span></p><p><span>线下举行。</span></p><p><span><strong><span>（二）活动规模</span></strong></span></p><p><span>60~100人。</span></p><p><span><strong><span>（三）活动时间</span></strong></span></p><p><span>2025年7月5日至6日。</span></p><p><span><strong><span>（四）活动地点</span></strong></span></p><p><span>上海市杨浦区军工路334号上海理工大学。</span></p><p><span><strong><span>（五）优秀营员</span></strong></span></p><p><span>夏令营组委会将综合评估申请者申请材料及入营期间参与各项活动的综合表现，最终确定优秀营员若干名。</span></p><p><span><strong><span>（六）活动费用</span></strong></span></p><p><span>本次夏令营活动将采取线下现场方式进行，夏令营不收取学费，中心将为每位营员提供夏令营活动期间免费住宿（标准间，两人一间）和餐食，营员交通费用自理。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>三</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>申请条件</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>（一）拥护中国共产党领导，品德优良，遵纪守法，在校期间没有受过任何纪律处分；</span></p><p><span>（二）对会计、金融、国际商务、税务专业有浓厚兴趣的三年级在校本科生（2026届本科毕业生）、或有以上专业及其他人文社科类、理工科类等专业背景的工作者；</span></p><p><span>（三）在校期间学习成绩优秀，学术研究兴趣浓厚，有较好的专业素养，有较强的创新意识和创新能力，有较高的培养潜质；</span></p><p><span>（四）有较强的独立调查研究、综合分析问题、解决问题能力。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>四</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>申请流程</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><strong><span>（一）活动报名</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>1. 请参加意向专业夏令营的同学在</span><span><strong><span>2025年6月25日</span></strong></span><span>前扫描下方报名二维码登记信息并上传报名材料；</span></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/kFX4Y5e2XrQAjXwX1ZibPHeoFnp7WgyHZW21XD4u1Qe7KAXRfElPJXicib10hmqFYAovAonUaG9roX83tmqkPVZiag/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>2025夏令营报名二维码</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><span>2. 报名材料包含：</span></span></p><p><span><span>（1）《上理管院专业学位教育中心2025年全国优秀大学生夏令营申请表》（见附件1）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（2）学生证个人信息页、注册页；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（3）身份证人像面、国徽面；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（4）大学成绩单；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（5）外语等级证书（如CET-4、CET-6成绩单等）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（6）其他证明材料（如各类获奖证书、荣誉证书、学术成果等）。</span></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><span>*注：报名材料必须真实有效，审核小组对报名材料进行审核后择优遴选营员。</span></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>（二）入选营员名单</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span>入选营员名单将于2025年7月1日前确认并通过邮件方式通知到学生。</span></p><p><span><strong><span>（三）负责人及联系人</span></strong></span></p><p><span>负责人：</span></p><p><span>会计（MPAcc）：于谦龙</span></p><p><span>金融（MF）：高广阔</span></p><p><span>国际商务（MIB）：秦炳涛</span></p><p><span>税务（MT）：田发</span></p><p><span>联系人：</span></p><p><span>会计（MPAcc）、税务（MT）：原晶晶 021-65710179</span></p><p><span>金融（MF）：马艳 021-65710380</span></p><p><span>国际商务（MIB）：宋立 021-65710178</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>五</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>活动流程</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><table><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><section><p><strong><span>7月4日</span></strong></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><span>14:00-17:00</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>营员报到</span></p></section></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><section><p><strong><span>7月5日</span></strong></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><span>09:00-09:10</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>开场致辞</span></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><span>09:10-09:30</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>中心培养体系介绍</span></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><span>09:30-09:50</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>奖助学金政策介绍</span></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><span>09:50-10:00</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>合影留念</span></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><span>10:00-11:00</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>公开课</span></p></section></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><section><p><span>午餐</span></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><span>13:00-14:00</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>破冰环节</span></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><span>14:00-16:00</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>项目介绍</span></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><span>16:00-17:00</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>校史馆参观</span></p></section></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><section><p><strong><span>7月6日</span></strong></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><span>09:00-10:00</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>主题沙龙</span></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><span>10:00-11:30</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>综合面试</span></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><span>11:30-12:00</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>结营仪式</span></p></section></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><section><p><span>午餐</span></p></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><span>*注：具体活动安排以当天活动为准。</span></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>六</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>优秀营员名单公布</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>2025年7月11日前通过</span><span><strong><span>“上理管院专业学位教育中心”</span></strong></span><span>官方网站（https://pdec.usst.edu.cn/）等多种途径予以公布。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><span>*注：以上政策如有与上海理工大学相关政策冲突的地方，以学校政策为准。</span></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>七</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>联系我们</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><strong><span>咨询电话</span></strong></span></p><p><span>021-65710178、021-65710179</span></p><p><span><strong><span>QQ咨询群</span></strong></span></p><p><span>会计（MPAcc）QQ群号：1036840261</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/kFX4Y5e2XrQAjXwX1ZibPHeoFnp7WgyHZ4ZFC0mr9IuQbjKrumDxic2zZLNRQfgib4NLMlKib8IDGIMOd0FTVYBsibQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><span>金融（MF）国际商务（MIB）税务（MT）QQ群号：1036933591</span></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/kFX4Y5e2XrQAjXwX1ZibPHeoFnp7WgyHZ2wOOGB2MUgwg7WLaN6Tic20Zas8C6aNia8VicxAvGj1J6Btq3vK8t6bEw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/5AuK01I9ayqaUAcjDMgAaw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>附件1：上理管院专业学位教育中心2025年全国优秀大学生夏令营申请表</span></a></span></span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/kFX4Y5e2XrQAjXwX1ZibPHeoFnp7WgyHZ3Aibia0AnQm6Yo1VszfWFQ0ibtDpUlaKO4j20Vt61MbaJWK1lQ7q9iaRkg/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>点击</span><strong><span>“阅读原文”</span></strong><span>了解更多</span><strong><span>“上理管院专业学位教育中心相关资讯”</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/kFX4Y5e2XrQAjXwX1ZibPHeoFnp7WgyHZUHnhJAI5cydTu9dqicIstNQeKg6hC6icP13cnE3yeZUmzwhwxIj0kzNw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"a016d29d2e0b5b58d8fdf0bd8d7dc1ccbe55bbd751636ccdcff2caf188659214","textLength":2526,"sourceSha256":"5b79cda3fa92d1db66d9e1e087313451f3695dd340ea4183d659a3588acb0871","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-1b4516ebae7579c2a485","title":"2025年上海理工大学管理学院专业学位教育中心 MPAcc/MF/MIB/MT 2025年全国优秀大学生夏令营报名启动","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:24.620105+00:00"}
